# 🏥 Hospital Analytics Dashboard

## 📌 Project Overview

An interactive Hospital Analytics Dashboard built using SQL and Microsoft Power BI to analyze hospital admissions, patient demographics, readmissions, treatment costs, diagnoses, procedures, and clinical outcomes.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- SQL
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Visualization
- Data Cleaning & Transformation

## 📊 PowerBi Reports

### 1. Hospital Overview Analysis
- Total Admissions
- Average Stay Length
- Treatment Cost Analysis
- Hospital-wise Admissions
- Treatment Cost by Tier
- Government Subsidy vs Out-of-Pocket Cost

### 2. Patient & Readmission Analysis
- Total Patients
- Average Patient Age
- 30-Day Readmission Rate
- Insurance Cost Analysis
- Readmission Rate by Age
- Patient Distribution by Discharge Type

### 3. Clinical & Treatment Analysis
- Total Procedures
- Total Diagnoses
- Average Comorbidity Count
- Average Haemoglobin
- Procedures by Ward Type
- Diagnosis Category Analysis
- Length of Stay Analysis

## 🔍 Key Features

- Interactive slicers
- KPI cards
- Drill-down analysis
- DAX measures
- SQL-based data analysis
- Interactive Power BI visualizations
- Healthcare-focused analytical insights

This project provided hands-on experience in SQL, data cleaning, data transformation, DAX, and interactive data visualization using Power BI. I analyzed hospital admissions, patient demographics, readmissions, treatment costs, diagnoses, procedures and clinical metrics to derive meaningful insights.

Finally, I published the Power BI report to Power BI Service and built an interactive dashboard, making the analysis accessible through an interactive and user-friendly platform.

